---
title: Hash e2e tests from the app code they import
description: Add the @nx-ultracache imports directive to an atomized Playwright or Cypress test file so its task hashes from the app code the file imports, and a change to one feature reruns only the tests that import it.
sidebar:
  label: Hash e2e tests from their imports
